1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:11,423
Associated Press reports that the United States will investigate European Union trade practices after Brussels fined major American technology companies.

2
00:00:11,373 --> 00:00:17,064
President Trump says the penalties are unfair and has threatened new tariffs.

3
00:00:17,064 --> 00:00:27,902
The dispute connects digital regulation with trade policy, adding pressure to US-EU relations soon after Washington announced wider import duties.

